# Keep LF line endings in bridge/ on every OS (Git for Windows may otherwise check text out with
# CRLF [mem]). Hashes of committed text files are recorded per session: package-lock.json in the
# Node host's hello (PROTOCOL.md 4.1), and server.properties and the gamerule files in each
# instance's hivemind-instance.json. servertool.py also hashes text with line endings normalized,
# so a CRLF checkout cannot change those hashes either way.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.jar binary
